      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just watching the lights go out on everything. everything i ever cared about, everything i tried to build... it's all just turning to ash. it feels like the end of an era, but without any of the glory. just the slow, ugly rot. i don't even know why i'm still standing here watching it happen.",
